; The four cube-sign cases and Kummer reduction in FLT/Three.lean:668-688.
; Actual lambda-free roots supply their fourth-power cube residues.
; A witnessed square divisor of the normalized right side yields an
; actual integer congruence for the coefficient, so its proved unit
; certificate forces one or negative one. No sign oracle is assumed.
